	<section_number>15.2-1240</section_number>
	<catch_line>Violation of § 15.2-1238 or § 15.2-1239 a misdemeanor</catch_line>
	<text>
		Any violation of § 15.2-1238 or § 15.2-1239 shall be a misdemeanor and shall be punishable as provided by § 18.2-12.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 15-548; 1960, c. 360; 1962, c. 623, § 15.1-112; 1997, c. 587.</history>
